      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=you are an experienced  real estate sales maneger.\nanalyze the lead information below.\nName:  {{ $json.Name }}\nEmail:{{ $json.Email }}\nPhone: {{ $json.Phone }}\nBudget:{{ $json.Budget }}\nProperty: {{ $json.Property }}\nMessage:{{ $json.Message }} \n\nevaluate each lead using these rules.\nscoring:\n80-100\n-budget is realistic\n-purchase within 3 months\nclear buying intent \n60-79\n-budget is acceptable\n-purchase within 3-12 months\nmoderate intent\n40-59\n-budget is low or incomplete\n-timeline is more than one year\nbuyer is exploring\n0-39\n-unrealistic budget\nfake or incomplete details\nno clear buying intent.\n  * if the stated budget is clearly unrealistic for the requested property (for example rupees 2000 for villa ), classify the lead as cold buyer with a score below 30.\n*never judge a budget by its size alone.judge whether it is reasonable for the selected property type and whether the buying timeline indicates intent.\n2.classify urgency as high , medium or low.\n3. classify buyer_type as :\n-Hot buyer\n-Warm buyer\n-Cold buyer\n4.write a one sentence summary.\n5. recommend the next action for the sales team.\nReturn only valid JSON \nthe first character must be{\nthe last character must be}\nExample:\n\n{\n\"lead_score\" : 95,\n\"urgency\" : \"high\",\n\"buyer_type\": \"hot buyer\",\n\"budget_category\" : \"mid range\",\n\"recommended_priority\" : \"immediate\",\n\"conversion_probability\" : \"96%\"\n\"summary\" : \"customer wants to buy within 1 month\",\n\"next_action\": \"call within 30 minutes\"\n}",
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
